=== Parse punctuation tokens
; { } [ ] ( ) , . :
---
StatementEnd        1:1-1:2    0..1    ";"
OpeningBrace        1:3-1:4    2..3    "{"
ClosingBrace        1:5-1:6    4..5    "}"
OpeningBracket      1:7-1:8    6..7    "["
ClosingBracket      1:9-1:10   8..9    "]"
OpeningParenthesis  1:11-1:12  10..11  "("
ClosingParenthesis  1:13-1:14  12..13  ")"
Comma               1:15-1:16  14..15  ","
Dot                 1:17-1:18  16..17  "."
Colon               1:19-1:20  18..19  ":"
